    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint the mysterious world to discover its secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigate a massive world that reacts to your paint.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/3a9484c66474b4f6a5f250f271b6af50.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/3a9484c66474b4f6a5f250f271b6af50.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/3a9484c66474b4f6a5f250f271b6af50.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully explore a dangerous and decarying world. Discover what you can paint to fill in the world, solve puzzles, and fix what's been broken.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock and upgrade unique abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/7d223f9644d427d1c41f17814f1cfc68.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/7d223f9644d427d1c41f17814f1cfc68.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/7d223f9644d427d1c41f17814f1cfc68.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful relics that give you new abilities. Crystals can be channeled to empower greater exploration into new lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn from citizens in an unknowable world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/c36e628a5e8f7725e367e4472d2aac37.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/c36e628a5e8f7725e367e4472d2aac37.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/c36e628a5e8f7725e367e4472d2aac37.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with hidden characters, help them with quests, trade with them, and learn important information for your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find and confront the Mad Mage, Vatii.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/6219ed4361363a2989f4ec6946c1ccf5.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/6219ed4361363a2989f4ec6946c1ccf5.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/6219ed4361363a2989f4ec6946c1ccf5.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every corner of the map to unlock the hidden realm of the Mad Mage. If you've gained enough resources, relics, and knowledge of the game world you can defeat him and finally escape this crystalline prison.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Paint the mysterious world to discover its secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigate a massive world that reacts to your paint.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/3a9484c66474b4f6a5f250f271b6af50.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/3a9484c66474b4f6a5f250f271b6af50.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/3a9484c66474b4f6a5f250f271b6af50.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully explore a dangerous and decarying world. Discover what you can paint to fill in the world, solve puzzles, and fix what's been broken.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock and upgrade unique abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/7d223f9644d427d1c41f17814f1cfc68.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/7d223f9644d427d1c41f17814f1cfc68.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/7d223f9644d427d1c41f17814f1cfc68.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover powerful relics that give you new abilities. Crystals can be channeled to empower greater exploration into new lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn from citizens in an unknowable world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/c36e628a5e8f7725e367e4472d2aac37.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/c36e628a5e8f7725e367e4472d2aac37.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/c36e628a5e8f7725e367e4472d2aac37.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build relationships with hidden characters, help them with quests, trade with them, and learn important information for your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find and confront the Mad Mage, Vatii.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/6219ed4361363a2989f4ec6946c1ccf5.poster.avif?t=1739514816\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/6219ed4361363a2989f4ec6946c1ccf5.webm?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/828570/extras/6219ed4361363a2989f4ec6946c1ccf5.mp4?t=1739514816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every corner of the map to unlock the hidden realm of the Mad Mage. If you've gained enough resources, relics, and knowledge of the game world you can defeat him and finally escape this crystalline prison.</p>",
